# Skills: Frontend

Purpose:
  Frontend skills for SDDRA system. Covers React, Next.js, performance,
  accessibility, and modern frontend engineering practices.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @react-best-practices/INDEX.sdd

Modes:
  APPLY    — apply frontend skill to current task
  REVIEW   — review frontend implementation
  UPGRADE  — propose frontend skill upgrade
  AUDIT    — audit frontend skill health

Rules:
  [F1] Frontend skills MUST cover performance, accessibility, and bundle size.
  [F2] React skills MUST follow current stable API surface.
  [F3] Next.js skills MUST align with App Router conventions.
  [F4] Frontend changes MUST be verified with browser testing.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd

  Resolve:
    react-best-practices

Navigation:
  Frontend: @frontend/INDEX.sdd
  ReactBestPractices: @frontend/react-best-practices/INDEX.sdd
  Design: @../design/INDEX.sdd
  MetaDiscovery: @../meta/SKILL-DISCOVERY.sdd

State: +